Ai jingsuk thiang kan dap kan shlei,
Ngam lab ban klet Rympei 1 Mei.
Bunsicn Sim Kiew ki her ki her
Ki kwah ban tip ki ri bapher ;
Hynniii halor tnad Jarymdem,
Mynta ha kliar ka Soh Jarem ;
Tang kane keifi ngam nang batai,
Balei ha ziga ka long ka rngai.
VII
Na sawdong Iyer ki skit ban lum,
Kumba ka sim ka her sha skum ;
Shapoh ki btiap u ngap u suh,
Sha ba syntiew bunrong ki phuh ;
Kumba u Dkhiew sha ling u kit,
Nga ruh nga am sha thymmei skit.
VIII
U Sohhiangriang ka Kharawab,
Kumne mynsiem jongnga ka dap ;
Ka kha-lap aw n Sohjabuit,
Hai hai pbin kbuit naduh tymbuit
Katba dang lah ban lum jingshai,
Nga pda l u khnam sha ka Hyndai.
Jingstad bunjait sawdong ngin wad
Jingstad ka ri ban san irat ;
Hapoh ki Kpep ki Mawbynna,
Ki pun ka hok ka jingshisba ;
Katba dang lap ban wad jingshai ;
Shaphang jong ki kumne nga rwai.
Ki jingabiaha jong ka Hynnin,
To ai kin lang u paid byllien ;
Kijingbakla jong ka Mynnor
Kum u tiew-ett kin shra kin tlor ;
Ban seng Lkwei lar kordor,
Ngi dei ban long hi iiew peit ngor
Ka Mangkariang ka dambit tat,
Ka ksam ka bah man la ki tnad;
